==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Bruxish|11}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Second Strike''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Rhyhorn|67}} and {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Rhydon|22}}, both from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

